# Performance Rules


## General

Performance must be considered from the beginning.


==================================================
DATABASE
==================================================

Avoid:

- N+1 queries
- unnecessary joins
- inefficient queries


Use:


includes()

preload()

indexes


==================================================
BACKEND
==================================================

Use Redis for:


- caching
- sessions
- frequently requested data


Use Sidekiq for:


- emails
- reports
- heavy processing


Never block HTTP requests with heavy work.


==================================================
FRONTEND
==================================================

Optimize:


- bundle size
- rendering
- images
- API requests


Use:


Server Components

Lazy loading

Streaming

Memoization when needed


==================================================
API
==================================================

Every collection endpoint requires:


Pagination


Avoid returning unnecessary data.


==================================================
MONITORING
==================================================

Measure:


response time

database performance

errors

memory usage


Optimize based on metrics.